@file 178:
@file 179:
@file 180: ### Stripes
@file 181:
@@file 182: set_db add_stripes_ignore_block_check false
When breaking rings, the power planner will consider the existence of blocks.
@@file 183: set_db add_stripes_break_at none
@@file 184: set_db add_stripes_route_over_rows_only false
@@file 185: set_db add_stripes_rows_without_stripes_only false
Stripes will not be created over regions without power planning wires.
@@file 186: set_db add_stripes_extend_to_closest_target ring
Setting stripe extending to closest ring.
@@file 187: set_db add_stripes_stop_at_last_wire_for_area true
Stripes will stop at the last wire target of the specified area.
@@file 188: set_db add_stripes_spacing_type edge_to_edge
@@file 189: set_db add_stripes_spacing_from_block 0
Offset for stripe breaking is set to 0.
@file 190:
@@file 191: set_db add_stripes_orthogonal_only true
@@file 192: set_db add_stripes_allow_jog { padcore_ring  block_ring }
add_stripes will allow jog to connect padcore ring and block ring.

@@file 193: set_db add_stripes_skip_via_on_pin {  standardcell }
@@file 194: set_db add_stripes_skip_via_on_wire_shape {  noshape   }
